                                                "sense_id": "afc4a649-3391-3a8d-8f44-9f2a571f30ea",
                                                "text": "Though FDR had a different message in mind, he unknowingly hit on something else: Phobias run the gamut of life and include everything from spiders to outer space."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40de9eec-019a-42f1-8bcb-fcee9db404e8",
                                                "sense_id": "afc4a649-3391-3a8d-8f44-9f2a571f30ea",
                                                "text": "Over the course of his [Eisenhower's] two terms in office, his administration's expenditures on public works actually exceeded those of FDR and Truman."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8fa8f3dd-4649-3a18-875e-d45df17a7e83",
